{"availability":"available","full":"Kunal874/pagesight","name":"pagesight","description":"Visual-document RAG: finds the right PDF page from page images (ColSmol + MaxSim in Qdrant), answers with a 4-bit VLM and cites the page. Evaluated on ViDoRe V3 on an 8 GB laptop GPU.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T17:02:07Z","updated":"2026-10-05T17:02:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["colpali","document-ai","fastapi","gradio","information-retrieval","late-interaction","pytorch","qdrant","rag","vidore","vision-language-model","visual-rag"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kunalchandrakar2005/pagesight-demo-index","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:52:26.310Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:52:26.310Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T19:52:26.310Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:36.430Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:48:56.961Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T19:52:26.310Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ask questions about PDFs full of tables and charts. PageSight finds the right page by looking at the page images instead of extracted text, answers with a small vision-language model, and cites the page — or says NOTFOUND. Evaluated on ViDoRe V3, built and run on an 8 GB laptop GPU, with a hand-written pipeline (no LangChain/LlamaIndex).","Ask tab, live run on a dev-split question: the answer cites financeen-1119; the cited page is overlaid with the heatmap of where the question matched. The 90-second demo video is not recorded yet. A hosted demo is not live yet: Hugging Face only lets accounts older than 30 days host free GPU Spaces (D-054); the demo index is already public at kunalchandrakar2005/pagesight-demo-index."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kunal874/pagesight/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"271b088884c84f7190746e485f769841ea7dcffc